anchor="t" anchorCtr="0"><a:normAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Dyslexia is a neuro-developmental learning disorder that affects reading, spelling, and comprehension skills in children. Traditional teaching methods and existing learning applications follow a uniform learning pace and fail to address the individual cognitive differences of dyslexic learners.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>This project proposes an </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>AI-powered Adaptive Multisensory Learning Platform</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> that personalizes educational content in real time using interactive games and sensory-aware instruction. The system continuously analyzes learner performance such as accuracy, response time, retries, and mistake patterns to dynamically adjust difficulty level and learning mode (visual</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>, auditory).</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="TextBox 2"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{42B4B64C-658F-ECCA-BF50-7B84E11F1481}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8686800" y="6488368"/><a:ext cx="914400" cy="369332"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg2"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>2</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-IN" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>